[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3446113685","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112026#issuecomment-3446113685","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112026","id":3446113685,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7NZ4WV","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-25T07:47:55Z","updated_at":"2025-10-25T07:50:31Z","body":"> It seems that the third plural form is for messages like this:\r\n> \r\n>  * 1 page\r\n>  * 2 pages\r\n>  * 1M de pages\r\n\r\nYeah I don't think that would work in practice with variable number strings.\r\n\r\nIf n is an arbitrary number like \"1000042\" you shouldn't add \"de\" in French, not would abbreviations like \"1M\" be used commonly. This \"de\" only happens if you spell out \"un/deux/trois million(s) de pages\" (or \"milliard\", \"billion\", etc.), which isn't something you'd typically be able to do with \"n\" in a string where n could be any integer. Technically a round \"1000000 de pages\" would be correct but again if it's a number that's meant to be any integer and just lands on 1000000 by chance, I would never expect a different plural like that in software.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3446113685/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3512074520","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112026#issuecomment-3512074520","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112026","id":3512074520,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7RVgEY","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-10T14:36:17Z","updated_at":"2025-11-10T14:36:17Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3512074520/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]